{
  "name": "WelcomeToTheFortuneCup_INTRO",
  "script": [
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "BG",
      "image": "5ds_citysquare",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "luna",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "He's waking up."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Who are you?"
    },
    {
      "char": "luna",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "We found you in the alley downstairs."
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "So we brought you up here."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "My name's Leonard, but call me Leo. This is my sister Luna. We're twins in case you couldn't tell."
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Not identical twins, obviously. She's a she, and I'm a he."
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "So who are you, mister? What's your name?"
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "discouragement",
      "text": "I have no idea..."
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "I never met anyone with amnesia before."
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "You're obviously a duelist with that sweet Duel Runner, so maybe this will jog your memory. Tell me if this looks familiar."
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Well? Does this Fortune Cup invite ring a bell?"
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "The Fortune Cup?"
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Yeah! It’s this big tournament between a bunch o’ people that KaibaCorp randomly selected."
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "It’s gonna be huge! And get this – they selected me! I’m gonna be in it!"
    },
    {
      "char": "luna",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "goodnightssleep",
      "text": "Actually, they selected me."
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "They technically selected Luna, but Luna’s too scared to enter, so I’m gonna pretend to be her and enter and win that thing!"
    },
    {
      "char": "luna",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "discouragement",
      "text": "No one’s gonna believe you’re me, Leo."
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Why wouldn’t they? We’re twins! We look alike."
    },
    {
      "char": "luna",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "shy",
      "text": "I’m a girl. I’m pretty."
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "I'll wear makeup."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "discouragement",
      "text": "Thanks for trying to help, but this Fortune Cup thing isn’t ringing any bells."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "I should get outta here."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "I shouldn't trouble you guys anymore."
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "But you still don't know who you are!"
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Before you go, I’ve got one more idea."
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "I challenge you to a duel, Mr. Amnesia Man!"
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Jack Atlas said that the way a duelist duels reveals who he really is. So if you duel me, you might remember who you are!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "I guess it couldn't hurt."
    },
    {
      "char": "leo",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "luna",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "To everyone's surprise, the duel did indeed clear Yusei's mind, and he remembered exactly who he was."
    },
    {
      "char": "tetsutrudge",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Soon after, Yusei left the twins only to encounter the very person who caused his amnesia in the first place."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "tetsutrudge",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "I was starting to think you didn't like me!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "AH!"
    },
    {
      "char": "tetsutrudge",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "I’m here to take you in, Yusei! So you gonna come quietly?"
    },
    {
      "char": "lazar",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Officer Trudge, aren’t you supposed to be guarding the Candles N’ Calendars kiosk at the Outer Rim Mall?"
    },
    {
      "char": "tetsutrudge",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Stop interfering with official police duty! I didn’t get your name, shortstack!"
    },
    {
      "char": "lazar",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "goodnightssleep",
      "text": "Special Deputy Lazar. I work for the Director General... and I outrank you."
    },
    {
      "char": "tetsutrudge",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "*gulp*"
    },
    {
      "char": "lazar",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Mr. Yusei Fudo, we'd like you to participate in the Fortune Cup."
    },
    {
      "char": "lazar",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "If you refuse, I will arrest your four friends in the Satellite for the crime of... hmm... I'll make something up later. Hehehehehe!"
    },
    {
      "char": "lazar",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "tetsutrudge",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "The next day, Yusei received another visit from his rival Jack Atlas."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "jackatlas",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "What brings you here?"
    },
    {
      "char": "jackatlas",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "I heard you’ll be at the Fortune Cup. I got a deal for you and your Stardust Dragon."
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "PROP_ON",
      "image": "5ds_stardustdragoncard",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "jackatlas",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "If you win, you can keep the card. If I win, I get the card. Then you and me are straight."
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "PROP_OFF",
      "image": "5ds_stardustdragoncard",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Straight? What ‘bout my friends!"
    },
    {
      "char": "jackatlas",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "What are you talking about?"
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Your purple-haired pal Lazar stopped by. If I don’t duel, they pay."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "jackatlas",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Well then, you'll definitely need your Stardust Dragon now, won't you?"
    },
    {
      "char": "jackatlas",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "And just so we’re clear – I don’t know anything about this threat, got it?"
    },
    {
      "char": "jackatlas",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "I duel for me. Goodwin’s got his own agenda."
    },
    {
      "char": "jackatlas",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "I’ll see you at the Fortune Cup."
    },
    {
      "char": "jackatlas",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Meanwhile, Rex Goodwin and Lazar met to discuss another Fortune Cup participant."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "rexgoodwin",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "lazar",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "I made sure the “Black Rose” got an invitation. She’ll be dueling here along with Yusei."
    },
    {
      "char": "rexgoodwin",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Then all is going as planned. Soon, the Crimson Dragon will rise..."
    },
    {
      "char": "lazar",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "rexgoodwin",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "BG",
      "image": "5ds_arena",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "At the Fortune Cup, all the participants finally came together for the ultimate dueling competition."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Since Luna was too afraid to compete in the duel herself, Leo gladly took her place."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "BG",
      "image": "5ds_arenahallway",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "leoasluna",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "",
      "text": "How do I look?"
    },
    {
      "char": "luna",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "discouragement",
      "text": "This is embarrassing."
    },
    {
      "char": "leoasluna",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "C'mon Luna, chill out! I bet it's like looking in the mirror!"
    },
    {
      "char": "luna",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "A broken mirror."
    },
    {
      "char": "leoasluna",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "luna",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yuseifudo",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Meanwhile, Rex Goodwin and Lazar met once again to discuss the tournament."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "lazar",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Everything is in order. Our D-Tector will pick up even the tiniest Ener-D energy signals emitted by the Signers. We’ll know for certain who the Signers are."
    },
    {
      "char": "rexgoodwin",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Excellent."
    },
    {
      "char": "lazar",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "rexgoodwin",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Now the first duel of the Fortune Cup begins! It's Greiger vs Luna– I mean, Leo!"
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "leoasluna",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "It's an honor to be dueling you today, Greiger! Put it there, pal!"
    },
    {
      "char": "greiger",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Hmm... Miss Luna, you have quite a strong grip for a young lady."
    },
    {
      "char": "leoasluna",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "*gulp* Uhh... Everyone at school calls me a tomboy. Hahaha... haa..."
    }
  ]
}
